  "description": "Provides self-service digital e-invoice (fapiao) issuing for Saobei merchants. This skill should be used when a merchant asks to issue an invoice for an existing order, issue a custom invoice for a product or a fuel gun, check the status of an issued invoice, organize invoice data the merchant already provided, or troubleshoot invoice failures. Results are delivered as GenUI cards by default, never as plain-text blocks. All Saobei data comes from the Saobei Merchant Service connector; connector-free tasks (organizing user-provided data, clarifying requirements, converting date ranges) must still be completed.",
